;; Campaign play only: the sky palace shares 2-1's Zelda II look and music, and puts on its own
;; palace art (the `zelda2-sky` sheet, [campaign-decor]).
campaignTheme: zelda2
campaignMusic: zelda2-field

;; Link's sky palace above the 2-1 coin heaven (reached by the hidden vine block in 2-1-sky), five
;; screens: the vine lands on the clouds among broken columns; a sky stair of floating palace blocks
;; rises to the great gate; the hall beyond, its floor broken once, holds captive Link on the altar
;; in its middle, three steps up under the triad crest, between two knight statues; past the hall a
;; balcony ends in a drop, signposted by a down-arrow of coins, that lands in 2-1 where the coin
;; heaven's drop does. Outside the campaign the same tiles carry plain ruins.

